  ANSI 颜色控制码如下 :

      □ 文字属性:  Text attributes

                 0    正常属性 ( All attributes off )
         [1m        1    高亮度   ( Bold on )                    [0m
         [4m        4    底线模式 ( Underscore )  (视模拟器而定) [0m
         [5m        5    闪烁     ( Blink on )                   [0m
         [7m        7    反相     ( Reverse video on )           [0m

      □ 文字颜色:  Foreground colors

                [30m30   Black
                [31m31   Red
                [32m32   Green
                [33m33   Yellow
                [34m34   Blue
                [35m35   Magenta
                [36m36   Cyan
                [37m37   White[0m

      □ 背景颜色:  Background colors

      [40m          40   Black                                [0;40m
      [1;41m          41   Red                                  [0;40m
      [1;42m          42   Green                                [0;40m
      [1;43m          43   Yellow                               [0;40m
      [1;44m          44   Blue                                 [0;40m
      [1;45m          45   Magenta                              [0;40m
      [1;46m          46   Cyan                                 [0;40m
      [1;47m          47   White                                [0;40m

        最後记得用 *[37;40;0m 还原就好啦!!

1.vi
2.i
3.ctrl+v
4 esc